     zzzzzz — suspend an ACPI or APM system

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     zzzzzz

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The zzzzzz utility checks for ACPI or APM support and then suspends the sys‐
     tem appropriately.  For APM,

           apm -z

     will be issued.  For ACPI, the configured suspend state will be looked
     up, checked to see if it is supported and,

           acpiconf -s <state>

     will be issued.

